    {
      "start_time": 141,
      "end_time": 183,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The ball continues, Jane and Mr Bingley have their first conversation. Further defines society, and begins to set up a barrier between Mr Darcy and Elizabeth. Mr Darcy doesn't approve of the match between Jane and Mr Bingley because of her family's inappropriate behaviour within society."
            }
          ]
        }
