          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The arrival of the officers to town also presents another barrier between Mr Darcy and Elizabeth in the form of Mr Wickham. He will become the heart of a misunderstanding between them, and also the heart of the moment of ritual death. "
